object:
Postherpetic neuralgia (extended-release): 600 mg in the morning on
day 1; on day 4 increase to 600 mg twice daily
Restless leg syndrome (extended-release): 600 mg once daily at
about 5 pm
Seizures (ages 12 and older): initial 900 mg/day in 3 doses;
recommended dose generally 1800 mg/day in 3 doses;
